        "Seven Pillars",
        "Seven Sages"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Heryshaf: Seven Pillars",
      "content": "King Deshret's seven closest retainers: the Goat King Heryshaf (chief), the Crocodile King Sobek, the Ibis King Thoth, Hermanubis the Greatest of Sages, the constructs Bennu and Shesepankh, and the Dendro Dragon Apep, who never counted herself among them. Heryshaf was deputy-king and the head of the Seven. Opening Aaru required their unanimous consent.",
