        "Aaru",
        "Golden Slumber"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Heryshaf: Aaru",
      "content": "King Deshret's unfinished afterlife, built from Celestia technology. Heryshaf, Thoth and Sobek were imprisoned there until Nefer's answer broke the seal. Heryshaf warned the scholars that the Golden Slumber lies within before agreeing to open it. In 6.6 it was repurposed to stand in for Irminsul.",
