    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "three questions",
        "Nefer's answer",
        "Goudarz",
        "Makhaira",
        "Nabu Malikata"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Thoth",
        "Aaru",
        "seal",
        "Ibis King",
        "Nefer"
      ],
      "comment": "Heryshaf: Three Questions and Nefer",
      "content": "Thoth's seal could be broken by answering three questions posed by Nabu Malikata. Goudarz and Makhaira answered the first and second; Nefer answered the last. Her first answer failed because it was her own; her second, 'time', matched King Deshret's and freed Heryshaf, Thoth and Sobek.",
