      "key": [
        "Lay of Al-Ahmar",
        "Al-Ahmar",
        "three retainers"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Heryshaf: The Lay of Al-Ahmar",
      "content": "A Jinni's tale of King Al-Ahmar and his three retainers, whose advice drew him toward forbidden knowledge. The Goat King proposed a palace surpassing the heavens, was refused, and fell silent. The story's veracity cannot be determined.",
