    "6": {
      "uid": 6,
      "key": [
        "Goatie",
        "chess rookie"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Heryshaf",
        "Thoth",
        "Sobek",
        "chess",
        "Aaru"
      ],
      "comment": "Heryshaf: Chess in Aaru",
      "content": "During the limited-time event Ruins Exploration: Fieldwise Center (quest Headlong Into the Sands, 6.1), Thoth, speaking through a cat, told the Traveler's group that Deshret had locked him, Goatie and Croco in Aaru. He called Heryshaf a habitual back-seat strategist at chess whose bad advice Sobek was quick to take, and said Heryshaf wanted another game to even the score. In the same event Sethos introduced Heryshaf's statue as the Minister of Ministers, 'the god Amun's most trusted chancellor'.",
